---
import LegalPage from '../../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { profile } from '../../data/profile';
import { t } from '../../i18n/ui';
---

<LegalPage
  lang="en"
  title={`Privacy | ${profile.name} – ${t('en', 'hero.role')}`}
  description="Privacy notice for eyupbahar.com: hosted on Vercel, no cookies, no tracking, no forms."
>
  <h2>Controller</h2>
  <p>{profile.name}, {profile.region.en}<br /><a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>{profile.email}</a></p>

  <h2>What this website stores</h2>
  <p>
    This website sets no cookies, uses no tracking or analytics tools and contains no forms. Fonts
    and all other files are served by this website itself, not by third parties.
  </p>

  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>
    The website is hosted by Vercel Inc., USA. When you visit, Vercel processes technically
    necessary data such as IP address, time, requested page and browser identifier to deliver the
    site and protect it from abuse. Data may be transferred to the USA in the process. Details:
    <a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vercel's privacy policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact by email</h2>
  <p>If you email me, I only use your details to answer your enquiry.</p>

  <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
  <p>
    Links to GitHub, LinkedIn and client projects lead to websites run by other providers. Their
    privacy policies apply there.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Under the Swiss Federal Act on Data Protection (FADP) you can request access to your data, as
    well as its correction or deletion. An email to the address above is enough.
  </p>

  <p class="legal__stand">Last updated: November 2026</p>
</LegalPage>
